clean_summary:
Cool work on curiosity adapted for 3D reconstruction and exploration, very fun.

@lily_goli: "Excited to share our new paper: Remember to be Curious: Episodic Context and Persistent Worlds for 3D Exploration. What does it take for an agent to stay curious in a 3D world? The answer is memory."

The project explores how an agent can maintain curiosity in a 3D environment by leveraging memory, enabling better exploration and understanding of complex worlds.

